//
// Moved VERBATIM out of worker-pulse's page (it lived inside one enormous
// template literal, where it could not be linted, tested or read). This is the
// only written record of retirement dates, pivots, coin ladders, event
// parameters and measurement traps, and nothing generates it — treat it as
// SOURCE.
//
//   EV_LABEL   short human phrase, for a ticker row or a map tooltip
//   EV_EXPLAIN the paragraph: what the event means and what to distrust
//   explain()  label + explainer, with the tier-3 line that lets a newly
//              shipped event announce its own missing documentation
//
// ⚠️ Duplicate keys keep the LAST value — that is JS object semantics and the
// later line is always the corrected one.

